<title>HONG KONG: HK Land Auction - Hunghom site fetches HK$6.06 bln.</title>
<headline>HK Land Auction - Hunghom site fetches HK$6.06 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 79,675 square foot waterfront site in Kowloon's Hunghom district sold for HK$6.06 billion at a government land auction on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
